        "coordinate_status": "OSM mapped feature representative point; not a navigation entrance",
        "art_english": "Renshou Hall at the Summer Palace: dignified broad single-storey imperial hall with gray tiled hip-and-gable roof, deep red wooden columns and door lattice, richly painted teal-green beam brackets, a low pale stone terrace and bronze qilin in the formal forecourt. Sober court architecture, no tall pagoda, no yellow multi-tier pavilion and no Tiananmen likeness.",
