        "osm": "way/727042890",
        "source_url": "https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/727042890",
        "coordinate_status": "OSM mapped feature representative point; not a navigation entrance",
        "art_english": "Qingyanfang, the Marble Boat at Summer Palace: a stationary pale gray-white stone pleasure boat at the northwest shore of Kunming Lake, low broad stone hull, two-storey European-influenced superstructure painted to resemble marble, decorative arched windows and ornate balustrades, large round paddlewheel-like side ornaments. It is fixed architectural sculpture at the shore, not a real sailing junk. Calm vivid blue lake and autumn foliage.",
        "minutes": 45,
