        "coordinate_status": "OSM mapped feature representative point; not a navigation entrance",
        "art_english": "Seventeen-Arch Bridge over Kunming Lake: long gently arched white-gray stone bridge with SEVENTEEN semicircular openings graded larger toward the center, continuous carved white stone balustrades with numerous small stone lion posts. Connects Nanhu Island and east bank, broad lake foreground and restrained willow trees. Render enough of the whole bridge to make the repeated seventeen arches legible; no single-hump bridge or golden palace roof.",
